ditional examples"}]},{"type":"text","value":" specific to the guide's focus"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add comprehensive troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for the domain"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update cross-references"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in related guides"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update the main README"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to mark guide as completed"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Delete the draft file"}]},{"type":"text","value":" once fully implemented"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"benefits-of-this-system","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Benefits of This System"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prevents scope creep"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in individual guides"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preserves valuable content"}]},{"type":"text","value":" during refactoring"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enables focused guide development"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maintains clear progression"}]},{"type":"text","value":" through the series"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Facilitates parallel development"}]},{"type":"text","value":" of multiple guides"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"content-sources","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Content Sources"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Most staged content originates from:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"navigate-with-search-params.md"},{"type":"text","value":" - Content moved to maintain focus"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation planning sessions"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"User feedback and common questions"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"how-to-guide-drafts","text":"How-To Guide Drafts","level":1},{"id":"file-naming-convention","text":"File Naming Convention","level":2},{"id":"current-drafts","text":"Current Drafts","level":2},{"id":"ready-for-implementation-substantial-content-available","text":"⏳ Ready for Implementation (Substantial Content Available)","level":3},{"id":"implementation-workflow","text":"Implementation Workflow","level":2},{"id":"benefits-of-this-system","text":"Benefits of This System","level":2},{"id":"content-sources","text":"Content Sources","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"# How-To Guide Drafts\n\nThis directory contains draft content for upcoming how-to guides in the Progressive Search Parameters Series. Each draft file contains:\n\n- **Metadata** about the final destination and dependencies\n- **Staged content** extracted from other guides to avoid scope creep\n- **Implementation notes** for future development\n- **Cross-reference planning** for proper guide linking\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\n- `{guide-name}.draft.md` - Draft content for upcoming guides\n- Clear metadata header with destination path and status\n\n## Current Drafts\n\n### ⏳ Ready for Implementation (Substantial Content Available)\n\n1. **`validate-search-params.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `validate-search-params.md`\n   - **Position:** Intermediate Level - Guide #3\n   - **Content:** Schema validation, type safety, error handling\n\n2. **`build-search-filtering-systems.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `build-search-filtering-systems.md`\n   - **Position:** Specialized Use Cases - Guide #9\n   - **Content:** Complete filtering UIs, search results, pagination\n\n3. **`search-params-in-forms.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `search-params-in-forms.md`\n   - **Position:** Specialized Use Cases - Guide #10\n   - **Content:** Form synchronization, state management\n\n4. **`optimize-search-param-performance.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `optimize-search-param-performance.md`\n   - **Position:** Advanced Level - Guide #7\n   - **Content:** Performance optimization, memoization patterns\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a guide from a draft:\n\n1. **Copy the staged content** to the final destination\n2. **Expand with additional examples** specific to the guide's focus\n3. **Add comprehensive troubleshooting** for the domain\n4. **Update cross-references** in related guides\n5. **Update the main README** to mark guide as completed\n6. **Delete the draft file** once fully implemented\n\n## Benefits of This System\n\n- **Prevents scope creep** in individual guides\n- **Preserves valuable content** during refactoring\n- **Enables focused guide development**\n- **Maintains clear progression** through the series\n- **Facilitates parallel development** of multiple guides\n\n## Content Sources\n\nMost staged content originates from:\n\n- `navigate-with-search-params.md` - Content moved to maintain focus\n- Implementation planning sessions\n- User feedback and common questions\n","originalRawMarkdown":"# How-To Guide Drafts\n\nThis directory contains draft content for upcoming how-to guides in the Progressive Search Parameters Series. Each draft file contains:\n\n- **Metadata** about the final destination and dependencies\n- **Staged content** extracted from other guides to avoid scope creep\n- **Implementation notes** for future development\n- **Cross-reference planning** for proper guide linking\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\n- `{guide-name}.draft.md` - Draft content for upcoming guides\n- Clear metadata header with destination path and status\n\n## Current Drafts\n\n### ⏳ Ready for Implementation (Substantial Content Available)\n\n1. **`validate-search-params.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `validate-search-params.md`\n   - **Position:** Intermediate Level - Guide #3\n   - **Content:** Schema validation, type safety, error handling\n\n2. **`build-search-filtering-systems.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `build-search-filtering-systems.md`\n   - **Position:** Specialized Use Cases - Guide #9\n   - **Content:** Complete filtering UIs, search results, pagination\n\n3. **`search-params-in-forms.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `search-params-in-forms.md`\n   - **Position:** Specialized Use Cases - Guide #10\n   - **Content:** Form synchronization, state management\n\n4. **`optimize-search-param-performance.draft.md`**\n   - **Destination:** `optimize-search-param-performance.md`\n   - **Position:** Advanced Level - Guide #7\n   - **Content:** Performance optimization, memoization patterns\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a guide from a draft:\n\n1. **Copy the staged content** to the final destination\n2. **Expand with additional examples** specific to the guide's focus\n3. **Add comprehensive troubleshooting** for the domain\n4. **Update cross-references** in related guides\n5. **Update the main README** to mark guide as completed\n6. **Delete the draft file** once fully implemented\n\n## Benefits of This System\n\n- **Prevents scope creep** in individual guides\n- **Preserves valuable content** during refactoring\n- **Enables focused guide development**\n- **Maintains clear progression** through the series\n- **Facilitates parallel development** of multiple guides\n\n## Content Sources\n\nMost staged content originates from:\n\n- `navigate-with-search-params.md` - Content moved to maintain focus\n- Implementation planning sessions\n- User feedback and common questions\n"}
